# Clearweb Health Design System

## Tokens
- Import colors from `@/lib/design-tokens` — never hardcode `#00C896`, `#00FFBA`, `#00E5C8`
- Surfaces: neutral charcoal (`void`, `surface`, `surfaceRaised`), not forest-green tints
- Accent `#34d399` for progress, CTAs, active states only — not body text on tinted backgrounds

## Typography
- Sans-serif (Inter) for UI chrome, labels, buttons, timelines
- Mono only for timestamps, IDs, CPT codes
- Body ≥ 16px; captions ≥ 18px in VoiceShell

## Forbidden (vibe-coded patterns)
- Green text on green borders or green-tinted backgrounds
- Inline `style={{ color: '#00...' }}` in components
- `font-mono` + ALL CAPS for tab labels
- Multiple neon glows on one screen
- Framer `scale` on SVG `<g>` elements

## Phase UX
- **Onboarding:** one focal card + profile checklist; voice shell at bottom
- **Scraping:** progress bar + human timeline (not JSON terminal); no zoom/spring on graph
- **Results:** map tab default; flashcards above fold; trust line visible

## Components
- Use `cn()` from `@/lib/utils`, shadcn `Button`, Header `.badge` classes
- Use `BRAND` from `@/lib/brand` for product copy
- Respect `useReducedMotion()` — disable parallax and springs when true
